  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9920.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La Cassola del Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este domingo, 4 de mayo, el espect&aacute;culo &#39;Veus femenines&#39;, con Irene Garcia Molina, Alba Arroyo Albert y Sussana Sebasti&agrave;, de La Rabera Ecl&egrave;ctica, a beneficio de la ONG Quisqueya.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9892.jpg\" alt=\"img_9892\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9893.jpg\" alt=\"img_9893\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9894.jpg\" alt=\"img_9894\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9896.jpg\" alt=\"img_9896\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9898.jpg\" alt=\"img_9898\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9900.jpg\" alt=\"img_9900\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9902.jpg\" alt=\"img_9902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/veusfemeninesbeneficiquisqueya/img_9903.jpg\" alt=\"img_9903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4